# Tic Tac Toe vs AI

A browser-based Tic Tac Toe game with a single-player vs AI mode, 
inspired by the visual style of Persona 5.

## Features
- Single-player vs AI with randomised computer moves
- Win detection across 8 conditions (rows, columns, diagonals)
- Asynchronous AI move logic with 1-second delay
- Dark-themed UI with animated transitions

## Tech Stack
- JavaScript (vanilla)
- HTML5 / CSS3

## How to Play
Open `index.html` in any browser — no installation needed.